From ec6e1448660d7de302f0d0acc704f134ea401b9e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alaric McKenzie-Boone <alaric.mckenzie.boone@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 08:58:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] lifetime: centralize Teki family forget on death and slot
 reuse (#397, #186)

Add pc_port/pc_p2_teki_lifetime.{h,cpp} with one authoritative list of P2
families holding a BTeki* registration map. Call pc_p2_forget_teki() from the
real death funnel (BTeki::doKill) and reuse it for slot reuse
(TekiMgr::newTeki), replacing the inline 18-call list.

The list mirrors the current fork exactly (behaviour-neutral), so no absent
Purple-direct/White-poison provider is referenced; newer families
(armor/kurage/onikurage/projectiles/sokkuri/giant-breadbug) are included.
Builds on the approved native baseline f14c6851.
